            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Synklok 1.0.2</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Automatic updates.</b> Synklok now checks for new versions and installs them in one click. Use <i>Check for Updates…</i> in the menu, or turn automatic checks on or off in Settings → General.</li>
  <li><b>Copy diagnostics.</b> Settings → General → Logs → <i>Copy diagnostics</i> copies a report you can paste into a message.</li>
  <li><b>Sample rate in the menu bar.</b> Optional, in Settings → General → Menu bar. A warning icon replaces the metronome if the M-1620 and MADI input stay out of sync.</li>
  <li><b>App icon.</b></li>
</ul>
]]></description>
